    "rule": "All 14 scenarios of 0.3 are re-run under tools/snapshot_model_04.py after the explicit state transform snapshot_model_04.upgrade_03_states (adds manifestLen 79, chunkCount 1, publishedBlock 1 for status 1/2 and 0 for status 0). Their expected results are unchanged."
